|HTTP Method|Route                                 |Description                                                                 |Role Required        |Request Body                                                 |Expected Response                                                         |
|-----------|--------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------|---------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|POST       |`/api/auth/register`                  |Creates a new participant account.                                          |Public               |`firstName, lastName, email, password, phone`                |201 Created + user details; 400 validation error; 409 email already exists|
|POST       |`/api/auth/login`                     |Authenticates a user and returns an access token.                           |Public               |`email, password`                                            |200 OK + token/user; 401 invalid credentials                              |
|GET        |`/api/users/me`                       |Returns the logged-in user’s profile.                                       |Participant/Organiser|None                                                         |200 OK + profile; 401 unauthorised                                        |
|PUT        |`/api/users/me`                       |Updates the logged-in user’s profile.                                       |Participant/Organiser|Editable profile fields                                      |200 OK + updated profile; 400 validation error                            |
|GET        |`/api/events`                         |Lists upcoming events and supports basic filtering.                         |Public               |None                                                         |200 OK + event list                                                       |
|GET        |`/api/events/{id}`                    |Returns one event with its categories, route and latest weather information.|Public               |None                                                         |200 OK; 404 event not found                                               |
|POST       |`/api/events`                         |Creates a new event.                                                        |Organiser            |`name, description, eventDate, location, eventType, status`  |201 Created; 400 validation error; 401/403 auth error                     |
|PUT        |`/api/events/{id}`                    |Updates an event owned by the organiser.                                    |Organiser            |Event fields to update                                       |200 OK; 404 not found; 403 forbidden                                      |
|DELETE     |`/api/events/{id}`                    |Deletes an event owned by the organiser.                                    |Organiser            |None                                                         |204 No Content; 404 not found; 403 forbidden                              |
|GET        |`/api/events/{eventId}/categories`    |Lists categories available for an event.                                    |Public               |None                                                         |200 OK + category list; 404 event not found                               |
|POST       |`/api/events/{eventId}/categories`    |Adds a category to an event.                                                |Organiser            |`name, distanceKm, maxParticipants, entryFee, minAge, maxAge`|201 Created; 400 validation error; 403 forbidden                          |
|PUT        |`/api/categories/{id}`                |Updates an event category.                                                  |Organiser            |Category fields to update                                    |200 OK; 404 not found; 403 forbidden                                      |
|DELETE     |`/api/categories/{id}`                |Removes an event category if it has no dependent enrolments.                |Organiser            |None                                                         |204 No Content; 409 conflict if in use                                    |
|POST       |`/api/events/{eventId}/enrolments`    |Enrols the logged-in participant into a selected category.                  |Participant          |`categoryId`                                                 |201 Created + enrolment; 400 invalid category; 409 already enrolled/full  |
|GET        |`/api/enrolments/me`                  |Shows the logged-in participant’s event enrolments.                         |Participant          |None                                                         |200 OK + enrolment list                                                   |
|GET        |`/api/events/{eventId}/enrolments`    |Shows all enrolments for an event.                                          |Organiser            |None                                                         |200 OK + enrolment list; 403 forbidden                                    |
|DELETE     |`/api/enrolments/{id}`                |Cancels an enrolment belonging to the logged-in participant.                |Participant          |None                                                         |204 No Content; 404 not found; 403 forbidden                              |
|POST       |`/api/enrolments/{enrolmentId}/result`|Captures the participant’s result after the event.                          |Organiser            |`finishTime, position, resultStatus`                         |201 Created; 400 invalid result; 409 result already exists                |
|PUT        |`/api/results/{id}`                   |Corrects an existing participant result.                                    |Organiser            |Result fields to update                                      |200 OK; 404 not found; 403 forbidden                                      |
|GET        |`/api/results/me`                     |Shows the logged-in participant’s performance history.                      |Participant          |None                                                         |200 OK + result history                                                   |
|GET        |`/api/events/{eventId}/results`       |Shows all results for an event.                                             |Organiser            |None                                                         |200 OK + result list; 403 forbidden                                       |
|GET        |`/api/events/{eventId}/route`         |Returns the stored route information for an event.                          |Public               |None                                                         |200 OK + route; 404 route not found                                       |
|GET        |`/api/events/{eventId}/weather`       |Returns the latest stored weather information for an event.                 |Public               |None                                                         |200 OK + weather data; 404 data not found                                 |
